-## 🆕 What's new in 1.4.1 / Nouveautés de la 1.4.1
+## 🆕 What's new in 1.5.0 / Nouveautés de la 1.5.0
 
-Every page that writes code into your project (test studio, Import Design, changelog, pair programming, quick command) now works on a review branch: a « Generated code » card waits in Human Review and you open the PR from it. The left menu becomes a rail of spaces with « My menu », four Toolbox hubs and a Labo for beta pages, and Ctrl+K finds all 77 pages. The board gains an « Open PR » column and a worktree purge, diffs use git colours with syntax highlighting for every stack, the first-run wizard sets up any AI provider, multi-repo changes run on the engine you pick, CI/CD Triggers start your pipeline after an agent's PR, and the learning loop's lessons reach the spec. Dependency alerts (oauthlib, glob, minimatch, fast-uri) are fixed. → [Roadmap](Roadmap) · [Feuille de route](Roadmap.fr) · [Release notes](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/releases)
+Agent rules become a versioned policy they cannot get around, every tool result is scanned for prompt injection before the agent reads it, and a red team agent attacks what each task built. A plan rehearsal replays the spec's plan before the build, and the migration guard says what a task's migrations would do to a production database. The quality agents (accessibility with a WCAG 2.2 score, i18n, API contract watcher, doc drift, flaky tests, compliance evidence, notebooks) cover every stack and fix on a review branch. The Release Train now deploys your services itself, the Git history surgeon cleans up a branch, Best-of-N gets an arbiter, the carbon profiler a monthly budget, production incidents from Sentry become bug-fix cards, and the coach learns your coding style and gives it to the agents. → [Roadmap](Roadmap) · [Feuille de route](Roadmap.fr) · [Release notes](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/releases)
 
-Tout code généré passe par une branche et une PR relue, et le menu de gauche s'allège.
+Garde-fous en code, red team et agents qualité pour toutes les stacks.
 
